1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,660
M: I was at the mall and saw this beautiful laptop.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,475
I couldn't help but pick it up.

3
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:05,890
Don't you think it's nice?

4
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:09,700
W: Yes, it's a very nice laptop, but why did you buy it?

5
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:12,400
I thought you just picked up a new one a few weeks ago.

6
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:18,520
M: I know, but I was not happy with the keyboard, so I gave it to my brother, and he gave me the money to buy this one.

7
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:20,615
W: You guys must have a lot of money.

8
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:23,020
These laptops cost an arm and a leg.
